{"title":"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Cuba 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Decompose the polynomial\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05abd2bb4c18e296b47a481cec755560d8ec40ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle x^{2m} - 2 |a|^{m} x^{m} \\cos ( m\\theta ) + a^{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"232\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e349c3441562c88539c4313e65436befd51648b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle m$\" width=\"15\" height=\"8\" /> polynomials of second degree with real coefficients.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a> to find that the polynomial is zero when\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/4/8642fca553e391aa3d69cf38066efec8b735dc3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle x^{m} = |a|^{m}(\\cos ( m\\theta ) \\pm i \\sin( m \\theta ) )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"248\" height=\"18\" />,\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>which clearly occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552d8025e1762d33cc9cdec715c2d51c76f5c390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle x = |a| \\left[ \\cos \\pm \\left( \\theta+\\frac{ 2k\\pi }{ m }\\right)+i\\sin \\pm \\left( \\theta+\\frac{ 2k\\pi }{ m }\\right) \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"373\" height=\"43\" />, for all integral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de61dde472a066a5b90a2ff0be7a2f756110011b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle k$\" width=\"9\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Hence\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cd62ca2eeae8769f5caf70a60b502dd50d9550.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{matrix}  x^{2m}-2|a|^{m}x^{m}\\cos ( m \\theta )+a^{2m}&amp; = &amp; \\displaystyle \\prod_{k=0}^{m-1}\\left[ x-|a| \\mbox{ cis}\\left( \\theta+\\frac{ 2k\\pi }{ m }\\right) \\right] \\left[ x-|a| \\mbox{ cis} \\left( -\\left( \\theta+\\frac{ 2k\\pi }{ m } \\right) \\right) \\right] \\\\  &amp; = &amp; \\displaystyle \\prod_{k=0}^{m-1}\\left( x^{2}-2 |a| \\cos \\left( \\theta+\\frac{2k\\pi}{m}\\right) x+|a|^{2}\\right)  \\end{matrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -47px\" width=\"734\" height=\"104\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Q.E.D.\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_2&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems\">1973 IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?p=603067\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017061813\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 365/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1680/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.658      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    5.658      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3837:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017061813 and revision id 9597. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}